OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a mixture of clear spells and a few
OL,7,Fshowers mainly in the west. Overnight
OL,8,Fsome more frequent showers across
OL,9,FPerthshire and the Trossachs. A windy
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with showers or
OL,13,Flonger spells of rain, some heavy.
OL,14,FSome brighter interludes later as
OL,15,Fshowers become more isolated. Fresh to
OL,16,Fstrong westerly winds. On the cool
OL,17,Fside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
